{
  "_lintCache": "exempt",
  "_note": "用户主动触发的核验流(输入代码点「关注」时跑一次),结果不该缓存 —— 缓存会把「刚才没连上」记成「没有这家」。生成器 tools/infosource/gen_secfilings.py。",
  "version": 1,
  "actions": [
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tRaw",
        "value": "${t}"
      },
      "_note": "入参落地(勿删)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tIn",
        "value": "$[toUpperCase::(findNotEmpty::(${tRaw},))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "reAmp",
        "value": "&amp;"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "rpAmp",
        "value": "&"
      }
    },
    {
      "action": "request",
      "id": "raw",
      "params": {
        "url": "https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=${tIn}&type=&dateb=&owner=exclude&count=10&output=atom",
        "method": "GET",
        "formatType": "string",
        "header": {
          "User-Agent": "Numable support@numable.app",
          "Accept": "application/atom+xml"
        },
        "timeout": "12000"
      },
      "_note": "formatType:string —— Atom XML 不经任何 XML 解析器,用 split 切(xmlParse 四端是四个引擎,对带默认 xmlns 的 Atom 结果互相矛盾;memory actionflow-df-pitfalls §xmlparse)。UA 是 SEC 要求的如实身份,不是伪装(见生成器头注)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_b",
        "value": "1"
      },
      "_note": "⚠️ 请求/并发屏障(勿删):request 与 concurrent 之后**紧邻**的节点读不到响应(晚一拍合并,memory [[actionflow-concurrent-late-merge]])。删掉它 → 下面所有 index:: 静默取空 → 卡渲一片 `--`,而流仍报 success。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "st",
        "value": "$[if::(contains::(${raw},<feed),1,if::(contains::(${raw},<html),0,if::(contains::(${raw},<HTML),0,)))]"
      },
      "_note": "有 <feed = 找到;回的是 HTML = 没有这家(SEC 对不存在的代码回 200 + HTML 页);什么都没回 = 没连上(空)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "nm",
        "value": "$[replaceAll::(index::(split::(index::(split::(${raw},<conformed-name>),1),<),0),${reAmp},${rpAmp})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tk",
        "value": "${tIn}"
      }
    },
    {
      "action": "resultFilter",
      "params": {
        "keys": [
          "st",
          "nm",
          "tk"
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
